      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the contribution to Android!\n\nI\u0027m coming in with some post-submit drive-by comments, because it looks like the current code has both potential use of uninitialized memory, as well as memory leaks.\n\nI don\u0027t know this code, so I might be misreading things.  But hopefully this is helpful, and I think we can fix things up by just changing a couple lines of code.\n\nThanks!",
      "revId": "07d755f6ba627fa32d42c1d0491b22f2d4e1acdf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
