      "writtenOn": "2025-01-31T17:54:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027d need to make a similar change here, doing:\n\n```\nmPolicyParameterMgr \u003d std::make_unique\u003cParameterManagerWrapper\u003e(/* useLegacyVendorFile\u003d */ true);\n```\n\nNote that this current code has the same memory leak issues as mentioned with the other location.",
      "revId": "07d755f6ba627fa32d42c1d0491b22f2d4e1acdf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
