      "writtenOn": "2025-01-31T17:54:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that we don\u0027t initialize `mPolicyParameterMgr` to `nullptr` here, so we\u0027re not assured that the logic we have which assumes a `nullptr` value means unused isn\u0027t assured to work.\n\nHowever, instead of initializing the pointer here, it\u0027s probably better if we...",
      "revId": "07d755f6ba627fa32d42c1d0491b22f2d4e1acdf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
